cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use RAAML Picto Studio in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "RAAML Picto Studio: A Model-Driven Workbench for Multi-Technique Safety Analysis"
abstract: >-
  An open-source Eclipse workbench for integrated safety analysis. It provides a
  standalone Ecore metamodel covering seven safety analysis techniques (FMEA, FTA,
  STPA, HARA, GSN, HAZOP and safety requirements) derived from the OMG RAAML
  standard, Epsilon Picto visualisations for each technique, a form-based FMEA
  editor, an EVL validation catalog grounded in normative safety standards, and
  bidirectional ETL transformations between OMG RAAML UML profile models and the
  Ecore metamodel.
type: software
